  "description": "A native, drought-tolerant garden by Gardener & Son celebrating local flora. Informal clumps of indigenous grasses, groundcovers and flowering shrubs -- kangaroo grass, tussock-grass, running postman, austral indigo and everlasting daisies -- weave through a low-maintenance planting. Year-round flowering supports bees, butterflies and birds, contributing to a healthier local ecosystem.",
